{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794760934504,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e0167c5b001qE9D0BWr4sjw3V","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e0167269001jlh0UeTcq1sfto","type":"tool","id":"call_2f270d13f0d74619bda053fe","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review && jq -r '.openFindings[] | [.severity, .id, .title, (.file // .location // \"\")] | @tsv' deep-review-findings-registry.json | grep -i \"transcript\\|behaviour\\|arena\\|routing-accuracy\" | head -40"},"output":"P2\t\t--backfill executes the hook and the advisor CLI from the directory a run-log line names\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\nP2\t\t--backfill replays a started-command row with the default fixture path even when the run used a custom --fixture\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tA 2> or &> redirect target that names a command document still counts as a start\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA corrupt Devin sessions.db suppresses the transcript fallback\t.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs\nP2\t\tA file name git quotes cannot be restored, so one space in a created path stops the arm and leaves the file\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/worktree-restore.mjs\nP2\t\tA heredoc whose delimiter is not a bare identifier is read as commands\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA measured turn inherits every credential the runner carries except the GitHub trio\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tA shell read counts as a workflow load but not as a start or a loop\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA started-command row selected by --row-id is logged under the pre arm\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tAn arm named paired is silently hidden or overwritten by the summary pair block\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tContainment is inferred from no git remote with no assertion that the checkout is a prepared arena\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tmeasure-brief-cost.mjs measures the child-session brief when it runs from a dispatched worker\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/measure-brief-cost.mjs\nP2\t\tofferReached counts an unknown brief state as reached\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tRouting-accuracy README structure table and code-file count have drifted from the folder\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tRunner README describes an unconditional restore and omits the exit code that skips it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe capture leaves its environment projection installed after it returns\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe in-corpus secondary holdout split is published per row and pinned by a recapture instruction\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe packet phase map leaves the per-runtime behaviour proof open while marking later phases complete\tspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/spec.md\nP1\t\tThe partner-side offer field is computed and then dropped by both offer writers\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\nP2\t\tThe README promises a paired block for any runtime that scored both arms, but the code requires a shared row\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README says a stored run line holds no offeredAs, but both current writers store it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README says every run line carries four attribution fields, but a head-moved line carries none\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README still says the backfill adds three fields and lists three in the runner row\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP1\t\tThe refusal and question rows can still carry a command, and no gate consumes the count\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe runner row says --brief-only rewrites the four fields, but that mode copies the offer fields untouched\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe scorer README says --row-id narrows either mode, but single-session mode ignores it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe started-command set row ids are a second source of truth for labels the scorer reconstructs from a regex\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tThe transcript scorer's header promises an ordered read/write report the CLI does not print\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tThe workflow block unscoredOnly count is never incremented\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P2\t\t--backfill executes the hook and the advisor CLI from the directory a run-log line names\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\nP2\t\t--backfill replays a started-command row with the default fixture path even when the run used a custom --fixture\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tA 2> or &> redirect target that names a command document still counts as a start\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA corrupt Devin sessions.db suppresses the transcript fallback\t.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/devin.mjs\nP2\t\tA file name git quotes cannot be restored, so one space in a created path stops the arm and leaves the file\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/worktree-restore.mjs\nP2\t\tA heredoc whose delimiter is not a bare identifier is read as commands\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA measured turn inherits every credential the runner carries except the GitHub trio\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tA shell read counts as a workflow load but not as a start or a loop\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tA started-command row selected by --row-id is logged under the pre arm\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tAn arm named paired is silently hidden or overwritten by the summary pair block\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tContainment is inferred from no git remote with no assertion that the checkout is a prepared arena\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\nP2\t\tmeasure-brief-cost.mjs measures the child-session brief when it runs from a dispatched worker\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/measure-brief-cost.mjs\nP2\t\tofferReached counts an unknown brief state as reached\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tRouting-accuracy README structure table and code-file count have drifted from the folder\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tRunner README describes an unconditional restore and omits the exit code that skips it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe capture leaves its environment projection installed after it returns\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe in-corpus secondary holdout split is published per row and pinned by a recapture instruction\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe packet phase map leaves the per-runtime behaviour proof open while marking later phases complete\tspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/spec.md\nP1\t\tThe partner-side offer field is computed and then dropped by both offer writers\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\nP2\t\tThe README promises a paired block for any runtime that scored both arms, but the code requires a shared row\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README says a stored run line holds no offeredAs, but both current writers store it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README says every run line carries four attribution fields, but a head-moved line carries none\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe README still says the backfill adds three fields and lists three in the runner row\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP1\t\tThe refusal and question rows can still carry a command, and no gate consumes the count\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\nP2\t\tThe runner row says --brief-only rewrites the four fields, but that mode copies the offer fields untouched\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe scorer README says --row-id narrows either mode, but single-session mode ignores it\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\nP2\t\tThe started-command set row ids are a second source of truth for labels the scorer reconstructs from a regex\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tThe transcript scorer's header promises an ordered read/write report the CLI does not print\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\nP2\t\tThe workflow block unscoredOnly count is never incremented\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review && jq -r '.openFindings[] | [.severity, .id, .title, (.file // .location // \\\"\\\")] | @tsv' deep-review-findings-registry.json | grep -i \\\"transcript\\\\|behaviour\\\\|arena\\\\|routing-accuracy\\\" | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794760932443,"en