ed facts and a one-shot `node --input-type=module -e` probe turned two suspected counting gaps into observed evidence instead of inference (iteration 1).\n+- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Direct import of the scorer's exported facts and a one-shot `node --input-type=module -e` probe turned two suspected counting gaps into observed evidence instead of inference (iteration 1).\\n- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\",\"oldString\":\"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794761331339,"end":1794761334625}}}}
