and `firstWritePosition(stream, checkoutDir)` as interchangeable: the missing checkout argument narrowed to a scratch-path edge and was ruled out, while the real gap was the absent write event (iteration 1).\n+- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- Treating `firstWritePosition(stream)` and `firstWritePosition(stream, checkoutDir)` as interchangeable: the missing checkout argument narrowed to a scratch-path edge and was ruled out, while the real gap was the absent write event (iteration 1).\\n- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\",\"oldString\":\"## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794761332966,"end":1794761334629}}}}
