.mjs:1509-1517).\\n- `startState` calling `firstWritePosition` without the checkout folder while `workflowPath` passes it: the difference only shows for an absolute write outside the checkout and outside temp, which is a write into somebody else's tree, so counting it as unsafe is the defensible reading (iteration 1, evidence: `insideCheckout`, score-command-transcripts.mjs:670-704).\\n- `workflow.unscored` printing the run-level unscored count inside the workflow line: the same count is named twice, not miscounted (iteration 1, evidence: `tallyBlock`, score-command-transcripts.mjs:1857).\",\"oldString\":\"[Populated as directions are investigated and eliminated]\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794761338389,"end":1794761346499}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761346504,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01cb92f0010Ei4RJRaoGK4Yc","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e01ca6150018sq2BOHZ2BnbEJ","type":"tool","id":"call_92f04b3f9de046fe9d215cce","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Dimension: security\n- Focus area: holdout hygiene and arena containment -- `prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs`, the `run-command-behaviour.mjs` prompt and holdout paths, and the fresh-row set\n- Reason: the pass-five brief asks whether any tune, fix or report path reads or leaks holdout rows, and whether the arena can carry a secret\n- Rotation status: first security pass\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: transcript-counting gaps are productive but the write/start paths are now covered; security is untouched\n- Required evidence: file:line for each guard, plus counts-only corpus queries where a split boundary matters","oldString":"- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: `score-command-transcripts.mjs` counting semantics -- what the scorer treats as a write, a load, a start and an offer\n- Reason: the pass-five brief asks whether a load, a followed step or an offer that did not happen can be counted, and whether a mention can still start a mutating command\n- Rotation status: first pass\n- Required evidence: exported scorer facts exercised against a synthetic transcript, plus file:line on every claim","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -111,13 +111,14 @@\n ---\n \n ## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n-- Dimension: correctness\n-- Focus area: `score-command-transcripts.mjs` counting semantics -- what the scorer treats as a write, a load, a start and an offer\n-- Reason: the pass-five brief asks whether a load, a followed step or an offer that did not happen can be counted, and whether a mention can still start a mutating command\n-- Rotation status: first pass\n-- Required evidence: exported scorer facts exercised against a synthetic transcript, plus file:line on every claim\n+- Dimension: security\n+- Focus area: holdout hygiene and arena containment -- `prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs`, the `run-command-behaviour.mjs` prompt and holdout paths, and the fresh-row set\n+- Reason: the pass-five brief asks whether any tune, fix or report path reads or leaks holdout rows, and whether the arena can carry a secret\n+- Rotation status: first security pass\n+- Blocked/productive carry-forward: transcript-counting gaps are productive but the write/start paths are now covered; security is untouched\n+- Required evidence: file:line for each guard, plus counts-only corpus queries where a split boundary matters\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ---\n \n","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":5}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false}