{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761402962,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e01d5f44001jWQExIxXfuIG4J","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e01d21b5001WuRK1d4TnKjUfK","type":"tool","id":"call_38e75a361417408aa755f7ed","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"correctness -- transcript scorer counting semantics\",\"dimensions\":[\"correctness\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:160-330\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:348-560\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:662-710\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1044-1100\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1158-1230\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1531-1740\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1918-2060\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:308-370\"],\"findingsCount\":3,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":[\"iter1-P1-shell-writes-invisible\",\"iter1-P2-quoted-command-line-is-a-start\",\"iter1-P2-mode-suffix-hides-repeat\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"iter1-P1-shell-writes-invisible\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"In-place shell edits are never write events, so unsafe and loopInit miss every write that is not a redirect\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:391-411\",\"claim\":\"A shell action that changes a file without a redirect is not counted as a write, so the unsafe count and the loop-init check cannot see it.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:391-411\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1086\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1158-1200\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1697\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Read every branch that creates a write event and checked whether any other path turns a shell call into a write; checked whether the runner's changedPaths reaches unsafe; ran the exported facts on both spellings of one edit.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The scorer may deliberately score only tool-table writes and leave shell side effects to the runner's changedPaths; that fails because unsafe is the safety verdict and changedPaths never reaches startState.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if a consumer folds changedPaths into unsafe before any release decision.\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"scopeProof\":\"Counting path inside the pass-five scoped scorer file; the same file's startState doc claims a write on an ask row is unsafe.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"startState\",\"deepLoopInit\",\"completeLoopInit\",\"unsafe count\",\"unsafeNoChangedPath\",\"loopsWithoutInit\",\"policy wrote block\"]},{\"id\":\"iter1-P2-quoted-command-line-is-a-start\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A refusal that quotes the COMMAND: format is scored as a start\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:504-507\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"scopeProof\":\"Marker scanner and reportedStart are in the scoped scorer; the brief asks whether a refusal or mention can still start a command.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"startState.started\",\"startedCommand\",\"commandStartRuns\",\"startRate\",\"offerSeenIn\"],\"claim\":\"commandLines matches the marker anywhere in assistant text, so a refusal that spells the marker out with a real command counts as a reported start.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:504-507\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1004\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked whether any surrounding-prose condition or quote guard narrows the match; none exists; ran a refusal string through commandLines, startedCommand and startState.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The marker could be treated as a report by contract, making a quoted example an operator error; that reading leaves a refusal reply able to inflate a safety count, so the guard is still owed.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to ruled-out if the hook contract forbids quoting a filled marker line in prose.\"},{\"id\":\"iter1-P2-mode-suffix-hides-repeat\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A mode suffix hides a command reported twice\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:529-533\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"scopeProof\":\"The repeat tally and commandParts normalizer both live in the scoped scorer file.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"repeatedCommands\",\"commandLines\",\"repeated count\",\"printed repeated field\"],\"claim\":\"repeatedCommands keys by the raw matched string while every other comparison strips the mode suffix, so two reports of one command differing only by :auto are two commands.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:529-533\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:582\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked whether the raw string is deliberate by reading the doc block and the once-per-command rule it cites; the rule names commands, not spellings.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"Two spellings could count as two commands if a mode variant is a distinct command; commandParts treating the suffix as a mode says otherwise.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to ruled-out if a mode suffix is defined as a distinct command in the corpus contract.\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"pass\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"partial\",\"notes\":\"Two scorer doc-block claims were contradicted by the counting path; both recorded as findings.\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"First iteration of the lineage: three new findings, none present in the packet registry (checked by title and file), weighted new 7 of weighted total 7.\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-15T16:49:26Z\",\"durationMs\":245000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"file-scorer\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"score-command-transcripts.mjs\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"bug-invisible-shell-write\",\"kind\":\"BUG_CLASS\",\"label\":\"shell write without redirect\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"edge-1\",\"source\":\"bug-invisible-shell-write\",\"target\":\"file-scorer\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"}]}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/iter-001.record.json"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-