{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761604433,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e020af9f001MoAp5B2OvTvIyk","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e020a4d5001RzHTB8BRQxibWO","type":"tool","id":"call_e206683d54484205b7e2b1e4","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"error","input":{"newString":"| D1 Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | In-place shell writes are invisible to `unsafe` and `loopInit`; a quoted `COMMAND:` line counts as a start; a mode suffix hides a repeated report |\n| D2 Security | PASS | 2 | Holdout guards hold on every run path; the arena's dotenv and containment claims cover regular files only and its copy flag is macOS-specific |","oldString":"| D1 Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | In-place shell writes are invisible to `unsafe` and `loopInit`; a quoted `COMMAND:` line counts as a start; a mode suffix hides a repeated report |","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md"},"error":"Could not find oldString in specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md. It must match exactly, including whitespace and indentation.","metadata":{"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"| D1 Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | In-place shell writes are invisible to `unsafe` and `loopInit`; a quoted `COMMAND:` line counts as a start; a mode suffix hides a repeated report |\\n| D2 Security | PASS | 2 | Holdout guards hold on every run path; the arena's dotenv and containment claims cover regular files only and its copy flag is macOS-specific |\",\"oldString\":\"| D1 Correctness | CONDITIONAL | 1 | In-place shell writes are invisible to `unsafe` and `loopInit`; a quoted `COMMAND:` line counts as a start; a mode suffix hides a repeated report |\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-