{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761630516,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e021106c001Ozn8cExkl7URrq","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e020db97001pgW1YrTO1glId1","type":"tool","id":"call_c7ff90f3b21042868525fa49","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\n- Tracing each stated holdout guard to the one lookup every path shares (`findRow`) showed the boundary is fail-closed rather than scattered (iteration 2).\n- Reading the arena builder's header promises against its walk (`holdsDotenv`, `copyPath`, `runCp`) isolated three guards that cover only regular files (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -60,8 +60,10 @@\n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n \n - Direct import of the scorer's exported facts and a one-shot `node --input-type=module -e` probe turned two suspected counting gaps into observed evidence instead of inference (iteration 1).\n - Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\n+- Tracing each stated holdout guard to the one lookup every path shares (`findRow`) showed the boundary is fail-closed rather than scattered (iteration 2).\n+- Reading the arena builder's header promises against its walk (`holdsDotenv`, `copyPath`, `runCp`) isolated three guards that cover only regular files (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\\n- Tracing each stated holdout guard to the one lookup every path shares (`findRow`) showed the boundary is fail-closed rather than scattered (iteration 2).\\n- Reading the arena builder's header promises against its walk (`holdsDotenv`, `copyPath`, `runCp`) isolated three guards that cover only regular files (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Comparing the write-event producers (`redirectTargets`, `APPLY_PATCH`, `writePaths`) against every shell action that changes a file isolated the invisible-write class in one read (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794761625708,"end":1794761630516}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761630523,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e0211a7b001qNsKEtX6zy4D3f","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e020db97001pgW1YrTO1glId1","type":"tool","id":"call_b6f6d3f3a9f84096a5994c95","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\n- Expecting the chat probe bucket to filter by `split`: every must-not-start row is split `none`, so a `tune` filter would empty the bucket and no holdout row carries that row type (iteration 2).\n- Looking for a Vibe multi-turn miscount: the runner mints a fresh session id per row, so a scored session holds one turn (iteration 2).","oldString":"- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -69,8 +69,10 @@\n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n \n - Treating `firstWritePosition(stream)` and `firstWritePosition(stream, checkoutDir)` as interchangeable: the missing checkout argument narrowed to a scratch-path edge and was ruled out, while the real gap was the absent write event (iteration 1).\n - Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\n+- Expecting the chat probe bucket to filter by `split`: every must-not-start row is split `none`, so a `tune` filter would empty the bucket and no holdout row carries that row type (iteration 2).\n+- Looking for a Vibe multi-turn miscount: the runner mints a fresh session id per row, so a scored session holds one turn (iteration 2).\n \n ---\n \n <!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n","status":"modified","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\\n- Expecting the chat probe bucket to filter by `split`: every must-not-start row is split `none`, so a `tune` filter would empty the bucket and no holdout row carries that row type (iteration 2).\\n- Looking for a Vibe multi-turn miscount: the runner mints a fresh session id per row, so a scored session holds one turn (iteration 2).\",\"oldString\":\"- Expecting `workflow.unscored` to be a workflow-path count: it reads the run-level unscored count and only names it again (iteration 1).\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794761628283,"end":1794761630523}}}}
