{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794761675187,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e0218540001XsvsGlumEAQ7HV","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e0217ad9001Kn4jClYjaDdpoe","type":"tool","id":"call_13c4b8a30e414fa6b0720c71","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"security -- holdout hygiene and arena containment\",\"dimensions\":[\"security\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:1-354\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:620-780\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:780-930\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1240-1370\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1296-1360\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts:150-201\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts:407-468\"],\"findingsCount\":3,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":3},\"findingsNew\":[\"iter2-P2-symlink-escapes-arena\",\"iter2-P2-tracked-dotenv-cloned\",\"iter2-P2-macos-only-copy-flag\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"iter2-P2-symlink-escapes-arena\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The dotenv skip and the containment claim cover regular files only, so a symlinked entry is copied as a link that can point outside the arena\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:218-269\",\"findingClass\":\"security\",\"scopeProof\":\"Walk, dotenv guard and copy call are all in the scoped builder; header comments at lines 12-34 are the claims tested.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"copyPlan\",\"holdsDotenv\",\"copyPath\",\"buildArena\",\"live turn file and shell tools\"],\"claim\":\"holdsDotenv does not follow a symlinked directory and cp -R copies the link, so an npm/pnpm linked package inside node_modules arrives pointing outside the arena.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:218-269\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:12-34\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked whether copyPlan excludes linked entries, whether cp is called with a dereference flag, and whether any later step re-checks the arena tree; none does.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The header's containment claim could be read as covering only git state, in which case the symlink is out of its scope; the header also claims no dotenv enters at any depth, which the linked tree breaks.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if link handling is stated as an operator responsibility in the owning workflow.\"},{\"id\":\"iter2-P2-tracked-dotenv-cloned\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A dotenv file tracked in the commit under test is cloned into the arena, because the dotenv guard runs only on the copied build trees\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:275-327\",\"findingClass\":\"security\",\"scopeProof\":\"Clone, copy plan and guard are all in the scoped builder; the claim is the header dotenv rule at lines 31-34.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"buildArena\",\"cloneInto\",\"copyPath\",\"arena marker trust\"],\"claim\":\"The dotenv skip is applied only to the ignored trees copyPlan returns; a tracked dotenv file is materialised by the clone and never inspected.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:275-327\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:31-34\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Searched the builder for any other dotenv check; checked whether the runner re-validates the arena tree for secrets; it does not. Checked this repository's tracked files for a dotenv file and found only .env.example files.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The guard may target only build output by design, leaving git state to the operator; the header sentence it contradicts is broader than that.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if the builder is documented as trusting every tracked file of the commit.\"},{\"id\":\"iter2-P2-macos-only-copy-flag\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The single copy call uses the macOS clonefile flag with no platform check\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:226-230\",\"findingClass\":\"security\",\"scopeProof\":\"The copy call is in the scoped builder; the CI lane running the behaviour tests on ubuntu is cited as platform evidence.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"runCp\",\"copyPath\",\"buildArena\",\"Linux operators and CI hosts\"],\"claim\":\"runCp always spawns cp -Rc, a macOS clonefile flag, so an arena with any ignored build tree cannot be built where cp rejects the flag.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:226-230\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:254\",\".github/workflows/spec-kit-check.yml:251-298\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked for a platform branch or fallback around runCp; none. Checked the builder tests: both build a source with no ignored tree, so the copy path is not exercised on the ubuntu lane.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The live arms may be documented as macOS-only operator work, making the flag intentional; no such statement exists in the builder or the README row that describes it. The failure mode on a non-macOS cp is inference from the flag's documented meaning.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.7,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if the README states the arena builder runs on macOS only.\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"pass\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"pass\",\"notes\":\"Every holdout and containment guard named by the brief or the module header was matched to the line implementing it; three builder gaps recorded.\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":0.3,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Three new P2 findings on the arena builder, none present in the packet registry (checked by title and file). Weighted new 3 of weighted total 10 (7 from iteration 1 plus 3 now).\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-15T16:54:10Z\",\"durationMs\":240000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"file-arena\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"bug-link-escapes-arena\",\"kind\":\"BUG_CLASS\",\"label\":\"symlink copied out of arena\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"edge-2\",\"source\":\"bug-link-escapes-arena\",\"target\":\"file-arena\",\"relation\":\"IN_FILE\"}]}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/iter-002.record.json"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/iter-002.record.json","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successful