m the working tree while its tracked tree comes from HEAD, and no step checks that the two agree\",\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:310-327\",\"findingClass\":\"traceability\",\"scopeProof\":\"Both halves of the mismatch are in the scoped builder and the claim is the module header the brief asks to check against code.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"copyPlan\",\"buildArena\",\"stampBuildTree\",\"arena marker\",\"every arm's attributed numbers\"],\"claim\":\"copyPlan walks the working tree while cloneInto/checkoutDetached materialise HEAD, so a dirty build is copied and stamped fresh, and no step or run line records the mismatch.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:310-327\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:22-24\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Searched the builder for a clean-worktree check or a build-versus-HEAD comparison; found none. Checked whether the run line records a commit or head; it does not.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The operator may be expected to build from a clean tree; nothing states that precondition in the builder, the README row or the runner.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if the workflow that invokes the builder documents a clean-worktree precondition.\"},{\"id\":\"iter3-P1-remote-guard-first-turn-only\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"The containment guard runs before the first turn only, so a git remote added by any turn survives the restore and a later turn can push\",\"dimension\":\"security\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1264-1268\",\"findingClass\":\"security\",\"scopeProof\":\"The guard call site, the restore mechanism and the comment are in the two scoped files; the claim is the comment above liveArmRefusal.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"runTurn\",\"liveArmRefusal\",\"restoreTurn\",\"statusSnapshot\",\"remaining turns of an arm\"],\"claim\":\"liveArmRefusal runs once per arm while a remote can be created on any turn and is not reverted by a path-based restore.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1264-1268\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:1403\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:610-613\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/worktree-restore.mjs:20-120\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Read the runTurn prelude and the caller flag, checked for a later remote re-check, and read the restore to see whether git configuration is restored. Nothing re-checks and nothing restores .git/config.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The check may be intentionally per-arm; that does not survive a shared arena where one arm runs many turns and only the first is gated.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if each turn starts in a fresh arena or the restore is shown to reset git configuration.\"}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"spec_code\":\"pass\",\"checklist_evidence\":\"partial\",\"skill_agent\":\"pass\",\"feature_catalog_code\":\"partial\",\"notes\":\"Two claims contradicted by code, recorded as P1; command-bridges README matches its deriver step for step.\"},\"newFindingsRatio\":0.5,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Two new P1 findings, neither present in the packet registry (checked by title and file). Weighted new 10 of weighted total 20 (10 from iterations 1-2 plus 10 now).\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-accuracy-runner-5-1794760565927-i99t40\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-15T16:59:18Z\",\"durationMs\":300000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\"