n the scoped files.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"MARK in both files\",\"buildArena marker write\",\"liveArmRefusal marker read\",\"arena builder tests\"],\"claim\":\"The builder writes the marker from one literal and the runner reads it from another, with no shared import and no test comparing them.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:61\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:523\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts:286\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Checked for a shared module that exports the marker name; there is none. Checked whether either test builds an arena and then asks the runner to accept it; no test does.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The marker name may be treated as a stable protocol string, in which case duplication is acceptable; nothing documents it as frozen.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade if the marker name is documented as a frozen protocol constant.\"},{\"id\":\"iter4-P2-arena-copy-path-untested\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The guards suite never exercises the builder's copy path, so the dotenv skip, the clonefile flag and the ignored-tree walk are untested\",\"dimension\":\"maintainability\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts:407-468\",\"findingClass\":\"maintainability\",\"scopeProof\":\"The test file is the scoped guards test and the untested code is the scoped builder.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"copyPlan\",\"holdsDotenv\",\"copyPath\",\"runCp\",\"stampBuildTree\",\"arena builder describe block\"],\"claim\":\"Both arena builder cases commit no ignored tree, so copyPlan returns nothing and the copy path has no test on any platform.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vi