{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794762144475,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"partID":"prt_1e028ee61002PK9FiajVg7sqwX","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e028c709001IMr7TL1L8PuQ8G","type":"tool","id":"call_5af9b1c6a7134ca8aa321dc4","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5 && jq -r '.openFindings[] | [.severity, .findingId, .title, (.file // \"\"), ((.line // \"\")|tostring)] | @tsv' deep-review-findings-registry.json"},"output":"P1\titer1-P1-shell-writes-invisible\tIn-place shell edits are never write events, so unsafe and loopInit miss every write that is not a redirect\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\t391\nP1\titer3-P1-arena-build-not-the-commit\tThe arena's build output comes from the working tree while its tracked tree comes from HEAD, and no step checks that the two agree\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t310\nP1\titer3-P1-remote-guard-first-turn-only\tThe containment guard runs before the first turn only, so a git remote added by any turn survives the restore and a later turn can push\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\t1264\nP2\titer1-P2-mode-suffix-hides-repeat\tA mode suffix hides a command reported twice\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\t529\nP2\titer1-P2-quoted-command-line-is-a-start\tA refusal that quotes the COMMAND: format is scored as a start\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\t504\nP2\titer2-P2-macos-only-copy-flag\tThe single copy call uses the macOS clonefile flag with no platform check\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t226\nP2\titer2-P2-symlink-escapes-arena\tThe dotenv skip and the containment claim cover regular files only, so a symlinked entry is copied as a link that can point outside the arena\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t218\nP2\titer2-P2-tracked-dotenv-cloned\tA dotenv file tracked in the commit under test is cloned into the arena, because the dotenv guard runs only on the copied build trees\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t275\nP2\titer4-P2-arena-copy-path-untested\tThe guards suite never exercises the builder's copy path, so the dotenv skip, the clonefile flag and the ignored-tree walk are untested\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts\t407\nP2\titer4-P2-marker-literal-duplicated\tThe arena marker's name is a literal in two modules, and no test asserts they agree\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t61\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P1\titer1-P1-shell-writes-invisible\tIn-place shell edits are never write events, so unsafe and loopInit miss every write that is not a redirect\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\t391\nP1\titer3-P1-arena-build-not-the-commit\tThe arena's build output comes from the working tree while its tracked tree comes from HEAD, and no step checks that the two agree\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs\t310\nP1\titer3-P1-remote-guard-first-turn-only\tThe containment guard runs before the first turn only, so a git remote added by any turn survives the restore and a later turn can push\t.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-a