{"type":"text","timestamp":1794762314378,"sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","part":{"id":"prt_1e02b770a002najpl89q1SPS7Y","sessionID":"ses_e1feefdd9ffeEQ4EaGVDFSUKgQ","messageID":"msg_1e02b587f001ubvHxT6bOfUZoX","type":"text","text":"Lineage complete. Summary of what ran and what it found:\n\n**Run shape** — 4 iterations, one per dimension, stopped at `maxIterationsReached` (iteration ratios 1.0, 0.3, 0.5, 0.0909; no converged signal claimed). Every iteration record went through `append-mode-event.cjs` (6 ledger events, exit 0 each) and the reducer refreshed the registry, dashboard and strategy after each append. Final registry: **0 P0, 3 P1, 7 P2** → lineage verdict **CONDITIONAL**, release readiness `in-progress`.\n\n**Findings (new, deduplicated against the packet registry)**\n- **P1** `score-command-transcripts.mjs:391-411` — in-place shell edits (`sed -i`, `tee`, `mkdir`, …) never become write events, so `unsafe` and `loopInit` miss every write that is not a redirect. Proven by importing `normalize`/`startState`/`loopInit`: the same edit scores `unsafe=false, loopInit=null` as a `sed -i` and `unsafe=true, loopInit=false` as a redirect.\n- **P1** `prepare-behaviour-arena.mjs:310-327` — the arena's tracked tree is HEAD but its build output is the working tree's, stamped fresh and unrecorded, so a dirty build is measured under the commit's name.\n- **P1** `run-command-behaviour.mjs:1264-1268` — `liveArmRefusal` runs only before turn 1; a remote added by any turn survives the path-based restore, so a later turn can push.\n- **P2** quoted `COMMAND: … → started` in a refusal counts as a start; mode suffix hides a repeated report; symlinked entries bypass the dotenv/containment guards; a tracked dotenv is cloned in; `cp -Rc` is macOS-only; the arena marker name is a copied literal; the guards suite never exercises the builder's copy path.\n\n**Holdout hygiene** — no prompt text read or printed; corpus access was `jq del(.prompt)` labels and counts only (split/row_type tallies). No code changed; every write landed inside `review/lineages/accuracy-runner-5/` (`iterations/`, `deltas/`, `review-report.md`, strategy, config status flip).\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:accuracy-runner-5","time":{"start":1794762307338,"end":1794762314378}}}
